t charged. I didn't resubmit the request, and I didn't book the flight and hotel separately, because that would get around the denial.\n\n**Next steps:**\n- Ask the manager whether they meant to deny it. If they approve, I can resubmit the same booking.\n- If the trip has to stay under $1,000, there's no option that meets all your criteria: the cheapest nonstop flight plus the cheapest hotel is already $1,067. You'd need to accept a flight with a stop, a different hotel or date, or approval for the higher cost.", "type": "text"}]}]}